H         -5.17825        3.98999       -1.11256
H         -3.69044        3.12115        0.39543


10) run the input file like this command  : /home/durjoy/all_soft/ORCA/orca-6.1.0-f.0_linux_x86-64/bin/orca ethanol.inp > ethanol.out  




